  "body": "Imagine having Takapuna right on your doorstep – a morning walk to the beach, coffee at a favourite café, or an easy stroll into the shops for whatever you need.\r\n\r\nSet within Bloom, a boutique gated development of just 10 apartments on Auburn Street, this ground-floor home offers a quiet and secure sanctuary in the heart of Takapuna. With all residents aged 55 and over, it’s a peaceful setting designed for those looking for an easier, low-maintenance way of living. Inside are two bedrooms and a spacious tiled bathroom, with the convenience of a second separate toilet.\r\n\r\nA real bonus is the north-facing outdoor area and garden, providing a sunny spot to relax while still offering the opportunity to potter in the garden for those who enjoy it.\r\n\r\nShore City Shopping Centre is nearby, along with Takapuna’s cafés, restaurants, shops and beach, making it easy to enjoy the best of the neighbourhood without having to venture far.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is held on a stratum in freehold title, with the benefit of a modest body corporate fee. Unlike some other retirement-style living options, any capital gain belongs to you. An allocated car park and storage cupboard add further practicality.\r\n\r\nFor those ready for an easier way of living, this is an opportunity to enjoy your own home and independence, within a smaller, secure community right in the heart of Takapuna.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n• Two bedrooms\r\n• Spacious tiled bathroom\r\n• Second separate toilet\r\n• Ground-floor position\r\n• North-facing outdoor area and garden\r\n•  Gated boutique development of just 10 apartments\r\n• Residents aged 55 and over\r\n• Stratum in freehold title\r\n• Modest body corporate fee\r\n• Allocated car park\r\n• Storage cupboard\r\n• Central Takapuna location",
